This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is scripts/validate-release-version.sh, which governs ai-dlc's own release triple
(commit subject, VERSION, CHANGELOG heading) and is not installed: a consumer writes no ai-dlc
CHANGELOG entry. On a consumer the fixture resolves no validator and prints
"PASS (skipped -- distribution-only validator)", so the consumer's pool recorded it `ok` on
every push while it tested nothing.

Its arms 20/21 bind the validator's citation regex to the shipped ledger-reverify.sh. That
binding needs both files, and only this repo holds both.
